sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant FE as Frontend (SPA)
  participant API as Backend API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  U->>FE: Klik "Logout"
  FE->>API: POST /api/v1/auth/logout (cookie access + X-CSRF-Token)
  API->>API: Validasi sesi (JWT) & CSRF
  API->>DB: Revoke refresh token
  DB-->>API: Berhasil
  API-->>FE: 200 OK + hapus cookie (access, refresh, csrf)
  FE->>FE: Bersihkan status login
  FE-->>U: Kembali ke halaman Login
